    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start, it sounds pretty natural. But looking at the dashboard, the score for this draft is actually kinda low. The marketing team wants to see more brand visibility for the campaign to really push the ComfortMax name. \n\nCan you rewrite it to make it more impactful? Try to increase that brand prominence quite a bit so the score goes up, but seriously—keep it sounding like a real human wrote it. Don't make it look like a robot just spamming the name, we'll get flagged if it looks fake. Just make sure the brand is much more visible than it was in the first one.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
